<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Electrical Shock</h1>
<p>Sphere: Electricity Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 3)
Mana: 12
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast electrical shock &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast electrical shock</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The air crackles as the caster snarls 'Thudas electra!', and a spark of 
electricity arcs to the target. It is the first and weakest of the 
lightning spells: the better your magic and your electricity sphere, the 
more it hurts. It does best against clothes, less well against leather, 
chain and plate, and a shield is no use against it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
